              "content": "{A笑眯眯}我看到<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>的田地施肥了，\n肯定是配肥成功了~！\n是不是好好玩？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635360_content",
                "value": "{A笑眯眯}我看到<style=PlayerName>{me}</style>的田地施肥了，\n肯定是配肥成功了~！\n是不是好好玩？",
                "duration": null,
