              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635361_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "因为我把啥子怪东西都拿来配肥，\n过去大家都叫我配肥霸王……\n{A害羞冒烟}<style=SizeSmall>自己讲出来好、好丢脸~！</style>",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635361_content",
                "value": "因为我把啥子怪东西都拿来配肥，\n过去大家都叫我配肥霸王……\n{A害羞冒烟}<style=SizeSmall>自己讲出来好、好丢脸~！</style>",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1087635361
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_3929961888_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "但有些些配肥的东西，还是有道理的，\n就像<style=Highlight>作物枯萎的植株</style>腐熟处理后，\n也是蛮好的肥料原料。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_3929961888_content",
                "value": "但有些些配肥的东西，还是有道理的，\n就像<style=Highlight>作物枯萎的植株</style>腐熟处理后，\n也是蛮好的肥料原料。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 3929961888
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635362_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "好多七七八八看起来没啥子用的东西，\n堆一起竟然能让蔬果作物长得更好，\n{A想象}果然没啥子是天生无用的……",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635362_content",
                "value": "好多七七八八看起来没啥子用的东西，\n堆一起竟然能让蔬果作物长得更好，\n{A想象}果然没啥子是天生无用的……",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1087635362
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "云果",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_710101_1087635363_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "那个嘛，我给你配了三种不同效果的肥料，\n你都拿起都用用，试试效果，\n肯定收获多多~！",
              "content_l10n": {
